<section class="research-theme">
  <div class="theme-heading">
    <span class="section-kicker" data-locale-text data-en="Historical research archive · Barra-style factors" data-zh="历史研究档案 · Barra 风格因子">Historical research archive · Barra-style factors</span>
    <h2 data-locale-text data-en="Long-run A-share style-factor performance" data-zh="A 股风格因子的长期历史表现">Long-run A-share style-factor performance</h2>
    <p data-locale-text data-en="Review factor definitions, long-run performance, annual returns, correlations, and sample coverage, followed by a separately computed market-cap decile study." data-zh="查看因子定义、长期表现、逐年收益、相关性和样本范围，最后补充独立计算的市值十分组研究。">Review factor definitions, long-run performance, annual returns, correlations, and sample coverage, followed by a separately computed market-cap decile study.</p>
    <p class="fine-print"><span data-locale-text data-en="Historical sample:" data-zh="历史样本：">Historical sample:</span> 2008-01-02 to 2026-09-04</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="callout">
  <div class="callout-title" data-locale-text data-en="Historical long-short composite returns" data-zh="历史多空合成收益">Historical long-short composite returns</div>
  <p data-locale-text data-en="The chart shows a composite daily return series for the high-minus-low score groups. It describes factor direction and historical regimes, not the return of an actual account. Barra-style factors can support risk interpretation and cross-sectional comparisons; their use as predictive signals requires separate testing." data-zh="图表中的多空收益是每日高分组减低分组的合成序列，用来观察因子方向和历史阶段变化，不等同于一笔实际账户的收益。Barra 风格因子适合用于风险解释和横截面比较，能否直接转化为预测信号，还需要单独检验。">The chart shows a composite daily return series for the high-minus-low score groups. It describes factor direction and historical regimes, not the return of an actual account. Barra-style factors can support risk interpretation and cross-sectional comparisons; their use as predictive signals requires separate testing.</p>
</section>

<section class="section-block">
  <div class="section-heading">
    <span class="section-kicker" data-locale-text data-en="Research design" data-zh="研究设计">Research design</span>
    <h2 data-locale-text data-en="Research question and methods" data-zh="研究问题与方法">Research question and methods</h2>
  </div>
  <div class="research-card-grid">
    <article class="research-card">
      <h3 data-locale-text data-en="Coverage" data-zh="研究对象">Coverage</h3>
      <p data-locale-text data-en="The study covers 19 A-share style factors. Each month, stocks are split into five groups; the highest- and lowest-scoring groups are compared with equal weights until the next month. Daily returns use high minus low. Aligning data by announcement date alone does not prove that financial information was available at the time; historical revisions and full point-in-time treatment remain to be verified." data-zh="覆盖 19 个 A 股风格因子。每月把股票分成五组，比较最高分组和最低分组，组合等权持有到下个月。日频收益采用高分组减低分组。按公告日对齐仍不足以证明财务数据在当时可见，历史修订版本与完整点时口径尚待核验。">The study covers 19 A-share style factors. Each month, stocks are split into five groups; the highest- and lowest-scoring groups are compared with equal weights until the next month. Daily returns use high minus low. Aligning data by announcement date alone does not prove that financial information was available at the time; historical revisions and full point-in-time treatment remain to be verified.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="research-card">
      <h3 data-locale-text data-en="Industry adjustment" data-zh="行业处理">Industry adjustment</h3>
      <p data-locale-text data-en="Scores are first demeaned by historical Shenwan Level-1 industry and then standardized cross-sectionally. Securities without an industry classification are retained separately rather than treated as if their industry adjustment were zero." data-zh="先按历史申万一级行业减去行业均值，再做横截面标准化。缺少行业分类的股票单独保留，避免把行业缺失误当成行业平均值。">Scores are first demeaned by historical Shenwan Level-1 industry and then standardized cross-sectionally. Securities without an industry classification are retained separately rather than treated as if their industry adjustment were zero.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="research-card">
      <h3 data-locale-text data-en="Sample coverage" data-zh="样本口径">Sample coverage</h3>
      <p data-locale-text data-en="Most factors cover about 18.6 years. Holdings, shareholder-positioning, and fund data cover shorter periods; fund-flow data currently span about 0.6 years. Their results should not be compared with full-history factors at the same evidentiary strength." data-zh="大多数因子覆盖约 18.6 年。持仓、筹码和基金数据的可用区间较短，基金流向数据目前约覆盖 0.6 年，不能与完整历史因子直接作同等强度的结论比较。">Most factors cover about 18.6 years. Holdings, shareholder-positioning, and fund data cover shorter periods; fund-flow data currently span about 0.6 years. Their results should not be compared with full-history factors at the same evidentiary strength.</p>
    </article>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="callout">
  <div class="callout-title" data-locale-text data-en="Do scores work, and can they be traded?" data-zh="评分是否有效，交易能否实现">Do scores work, and can they be traded?</div>
  <p data-locale-text data-en="IC measures the linear correlation between factor scores and future returns; Rank IC measures rank agreement. An IC near zero indicates little linear relationship between score levels and future returns. Q1–Q10 in this study are decile portfolios ordered from low to high scores, the reverse of some Barra long-short charts. Use each chart title and factor definition to confirm direction." data-zh="IC 衡量因子分数与未来收益的线性相关性，Rank IC 衡量排序是否一致。IC 接近 0，表示分数高低与未来收益没有明显线性关系。研究中的 Q1 到 Q10 是从低分到高分的十分位组合，方向与部分 Barra 多空图表相反，阅读时要以图表标题和因子定义为准。">IC measures the linear correlation between factor scores and future returns; Rank IC measures rank agreement. An IC near zero indicates little linear relationship between score levels and future returns. Q1–Q10 in this study are decile portfolios ordered from low to high scores, the reverse of some Barra long-short charts. Use each chart title and factor definition to confirm direction.</p>
</section>

<p class="fine-print"><span class="section-kicker" data-locale-text data-en="Research limitations" data-zh="研究限制">Research limitations</span> <span data-locale-text data-en="Factor direction and portfolio construction are described above. Transaction costs, suspensions, price-limit execution, and a complete tradability audit still need a consistent treatment. Some fund, shareholder-positioning, and flow series cover shorter periods, so those results remain exploratory." data-zh="因子方向和组合口径已在页面中说明，但交易成本、停牌处理、涨跌停成交约束和完整的可交易性检查仍需进一步统一。部分基金、筹码和资金流数据覆盖期较短，相关结果只适合作为探索性证据。">Factor direction and portfolio construction are described above. Transaction costs, suspensions, price-limit execution, and a complete tradability audit still need a consistent treatment. Some fund, shareholder-positioning, and flow series cover shorter periods, so those results remain exploratory.</span></p>
